# AI Novel Writer

Offline AI-powered novel writing tool inspired by Sudowrite.

## Tech Stack
- Frontend: Next.js + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS
- Backend: Python FastAPI
- AI: Ollama (Llama 3.2) — runs locally

## Features
- Multiple project management
- AI Write, Rewrite, Describe tools
- AI Chat assistant for story help
- Auto Story Bible (character extraction)
- 100% offline & private

## Setup
1. Install Ollama: https://ollama.ai
2. Run: `ollama pull llama3.2:1b`
3. Backend: `pip install fastapi uvicorn ollama` → `python main.py`
4. Frontend: `npm install` → `npm run dev`
5. Open: http://localhost:3000
